<title>UK: Biocompatibles says J&amp;J unit to reduce stake.</title>
<headline>Biocompatibles says J&amp;J unit to reduce stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British medical devices firm Biocompatibles Plc said on Wednesday that a unit of U.S. group Johnson &amp; Johnson planned to dispose of about 1.5 million Biocompatibles shares.</p>
</text>
